OL,3,GNEWSAMajor solar farm could be built
OL,4,Anear villages
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major solar farm that would
OL,7,Fpotentially power about 140,000 homes
OL,8,Fannually could be built close to
OL,9,Fseveral Oxfordshire villages, the
OL,10,Fcompany behind the plan has said.
OL,12,FCearn Solar Farm could be built across
OL,13,Fabout 2,800 acres (1,133 hectares) on
OL,14,Fthree sites in the Vale of White Horse,
OL,15,Fnear villages including West Hanney,
OL,16,FGoosey and Charney Bassett.
OL,18,FTelis Energy UK said it would be
OL,19,Fconnected to the National Grid by
OL,20,Funderground cables to the Farmoor
OL,21,Fsubstation, near Oxford, about 7.4
OL,22,Fmiles (12km) away.
